RECOMMENDED
  SEN-101  sql_injection         Review the queries of the endpoint; use parameters, never text put together. (CWE-89, ATT&CK T1190)
  SEN-102  command_injection     Check the host for commands run by the web service; never pass input to a shell. (CWE-78, ATT&CK T1190)
  SEN-103  cross_site_scripting  Encode output in the page named; add a Content-Security-Policy. (CWE-79)
  SEN-104  path_traversal        Resolve file names inside one folder and refuse the rest. (CWE-22)
  SEN-105  sensitive_file        Make sure the file is not served; rotate any secret that was answered with 200. (CWE-538)
  SEN-106  scanner               Expect more requests from this address; rate-limit it. (ATT&CK T1595.002)
  SEN-107  server_side_request   Allow only the hosts the feature needs; never fetch an address a request gives. (CWE-918 (SSRF))
  SEN-108  jndi_injection        Update Log4j and check the host for connections to the address named. (CWE-917, CVE-2021-44228)
  SEN-201  brute_force           Lock the accounts tried and require a second factor. (CWE-307, ATT&CK T1110)
  SEN-202  login_after_failures  Treat the account as compromised: end its sessions and reset its password. (ATT&CK T1078)
  SEN-203  enumeration           Rate-limit requests that are answered 404. (ATT&CK T1595.003)
  SEN-204  object_enumeration    Check that the endpoint answers only for objects of the user who asks; use ids that cannot be guessed. (CWE-639 (IDOR))
  SEN-205  foreign_object        Confirm the user may read that object; if not, the endpoint does not check the owner. (CWE-639 (IDOR))
  SEN-206  login_from_many       Lock the account and require a second factor; blocking one address does not stop it. (ATT&CK T1110)
  SEN-301  hidden_text           Open the line with a tool that shows every character before trusting it. (CWE-117, ATT&CK T1036.002)
  SEN-302  oversized_line        Limit the length of a request at the proxy. (CWE-400)
  SEN-303  malformed_line        Check what writes this log; a broken line can hide an entry. (CWE-117)

